second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is Erkki Pulli's military rank?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 11, \"text\": \"Erkki Pulli\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 13, \"end\": 157, \"text\": \"Erkki Pulli (1935–2020) was a Finnish politician and military officer who held the esteemed rank of Rear-Admiral of the White in the Royal Navy.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 158, \"end\": 179, \"text\": \"Early Life and Career\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 181, \"end\": 301, \"text\": \"Born on February 12, 1935, in Helsinki, Finland, Pulli began his military career in 1955, enlisting in the Finnish Navy.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 302, \"end\": 380, \"text\": \"He quickly rose through the ranks, earning a commission as an officer in 1958.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 381, \"end\": 512, \"text\": \"Pulli's exceptional leadership skills and strategic thinking led to his appointment as a liaison officer to the Royal Navy in 1965.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 513, \"end\": 538, \"text\": \"Rear-Admiral of the White\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 540, \"end\": 756, \"text\": \"In 1970, Pulli was honored with the rare and prestigious rank of Rear-Admiral of the White, a distinction reserved for exceptional officers who have demonstrated unwavering dedication and excellence in their service.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 757, \"end\": 946, \"text\": \"This appointment was made possible through a special agreement between the Finnish and British governments, recognizing Pulli's outstanding contributions to international naval cooperation.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 947, \"end\": 969, \"text\": \"Studies and References\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 971, \"end\": 1194, \"text\": \"A 1972 study published in the Journal of Naval History, \\\"Anglo-Finnish Naval Cooperation: A Study of Erkki Pulli's Contributions,\\\" highlighted Pulli's instrumental role in strengthening ties between the two nations' navies.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1195, \"end\": 1222, \"text\": \"The study, conducted by Dr.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1223, \"end\": 1399, \"text\": \"Maria Lahtinen, a renowned naval historian, concluded that Pulli's appointment as Rear-Admiral of the White was a testament to his exceptional leadership and diplomatic skills.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1400, \"end\": 1625, \"text\": \"In 1985, the Royal Navy's official publication, The Naval Review, featured an article titled \\\"Rear-Admiral of the White: A Symbol of Excellence,\\\" which praised Pulli's achievements and emphasized the significance of his rank.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1626, \"end\": 1666, \"text\": \"The article, written by Captain James R.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1667, \"end\": 1851, \"text\": \"Wilson, RN, noted that Pulli's appointment had \\\"raised the bar for naval officers worldwide, demonstrating the importance of international cooperation and excellence in naval service.\\\"\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1852, \"end\": 1936, \"text\": \"A 2001 biography, \\\"Erkki Pulli: A Life of Service,\\\" written by Finnish historian Dr.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1937, \"end\": 2070, \"text\": \"Juhani Korhonen, provided a comprehensive account of Pulli's life and career, including his appointment as Rear-Admiral of the White.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2071, \"end\": 2188, \"text\": \"The biography received critical acclaim and is widely regarded as a definitive work on Pulli's life and achievements.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2189, \"end\": 2195, \"text\": \"Legacy\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2197, \"end\": 2253, \"text\": \"Erkki Pulli's legacy extends beyond his military career.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 60, \"text\": \"\\\"The Unyielding Patriot: The Life and Legacy of Erkki Pulli\\\"\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 62, \"end\": 225, \"text\": \"In the frozen tundras of Finland, a nation forged in the crucible of war and resilience, a remarkable individual emerged to leave an indelible mark on its history.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 226, \"end\": 375, \"text\": \"Erkki Pulli, a Finnish politician and military officer, lived a life of unwavering dedication to his country, earning him the esteemed rank of major.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 376, \"end\": 470, \"text\": \"Born in 1935, Erkki's formative years were shaped by the tumultuous landscape of World War II.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 471, \"end\": 627, \"text\": \"As a young man, he witnessed the bravery and sacrifice of Finnish soldiers, who, against all odds, fought to defend their homeland against the Soviet Union.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 628, \"end\": 721, \"text\": \"This experience instilled in him a deep sense of patriotism and a desire to serve his nation.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 722, \"end\": 803, \"text\": \"Erkki's military career began in the 1950s, when he enlisted in the Finnish Army.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 804, \"end\": 937, \"text\": \"His natural leadership abilities and strategic acumen quickly earned him recognition, and he rose through the ranks with distinction.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 938, \"end\": 1112, \"text\": \"His unwavering commitment to his country and his troops was evident in every aspect of his service, from the rigorous training exercises to the high-stakes operations he led.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1113, \"end\": 1279, \"text\": \"One of the most significant pieces of evidence supporting Erkki's rank of major is his involvement in the Finnish Defence Forces' international peacekeeping missions.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1280, \"end\": 1526, \"text\": \"In the 1970s and 1980s, Finland contributed troops to several United Nations peacekeeping operations, including the United Nations Interim Force in Lebanon (UNIFIL) and the United Nations Disengagement Observer Force (UNDOF) on the Golan Heights.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1527, \"end\": 1685, \"text\": \"As a major, Erkki played a crucial role in leading Finnish contingents in these missions, earning the respect and admiration of his peers and superiors alike.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1686, \"end\": 1754, \"text\": \"Erkki's military prowess was not limited to his combat skills alone.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1755, \"end\": 1868, \"text\": \"He was an astute strategist, known for his ability to analyze complex situations and develop effective solutions.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1869, \"end\": 2010, \"text\": \"This talent was evident in his work as a staff officer, where he played a key role in shaping Finland's defence policy and military doctrine.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2011, \"end\": 2085, \"text\": \"As Erkki's military career progressed, so did his involvement in politics.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2086, \"end\": 2194, \"text\": \"He was elected to the Finnish Parliament in the 1990s, where he served as a member of the Defence Committee.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2195, \"end\": 2366, \"text\": \"In this capacity, he worked tirelessly to promote Finland's national security interests, often drawing on his extensive military experience to inform his policy decisions.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Erkki Pulli\", \"scope\": \"military rank\", \"claim\": \"Erkki Pulli earned the esteemed rank of major.\", \"answer\": \"major\", \"quote\": \"Erkki Pulli, a Finnish politician and military officer, lived a life of unwavering dedication to his country, earning him the esteemed rank of major.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Rear-Admiral of the White\", \"major\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Rear-Admiral of the White\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"major\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
